WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.803
"Moo! Moo! Moo!" cried Cow.

2
00:00:28.804 --> 00:00:32.987
Bat and Pig came fast.

3
00:00:32.988 --> 00:00:36.646
"Cat was in Farmer's truck," said Cow.

4
00:00:36.647 --> 00:00:38.808
"Farmer came back.

5
00:00:38.809 --> 00:00:46.911
But Cat did not!"

6
00:00:46.912 --> 00:00:55.939
Cat missed the farm.

7
00:00:55.940 --> 00:01:02.320
She missed her friends.

8
00:01:02.321 --> 00:01:23.420
Cat went up the pole.

9
00:01:23.421 --> 00:01:27.065
She did not see her home.

10
00:01:27.066 --> 00:01:35.603
"I will find Cat," said Bat.

11
00:01:35.604 --> 00:01:41.960
Bat flew past the park.

12
00:01:41.961 --> 00:01:47.410
But he did not see Cat.

13
00:01:47.411 --> 00:01:55.762
He flew past the school.

14
00:01:55.763 --> 00:02:00.514
He flew into town.

15
00:02:00.515 --> 00:02:05.644
He flew all around.

16
00:02:05.645 --> 00:02:10.901
But he did not see Cat.

17
00:02:10.902 --> 00:02:14.306
Then Bat heard something.

18
00:02:14.307 --> 00:02:27.001
It was . . . Cat!

19
00:02:27.002 --> 00:02:30.541
"Bat!" cried Cat.

20
00:02:30.542 --> 00:02:33.029
"Can you take me home?"

21
00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:45.107
"Yes," said Bat.

22
00:02:45.108 --> 00:02:52.294
And off they went!

